   "created_at": "2025-08-24T11:19:20+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>Went into multiple raids of custom and factory and have only found 2 when going through all of the weapon crates on factory and half of the weapon crates on customs. Rolled out a version 1.0.1 that reduces the spawn rate by a half. If the issue persists please go into &gt; user\\mods\\ShashaCZ-RX01\\db\\Items and open RX01.json and set \u201caddtoStaticLootContainers\u201d to false. That should fix it for sure.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
